  "note": "Track hearing-changes (theory-ear), step 5, on the song-chart tool with `hide`: the band plays a made-up song while the chart shows its bars with the chord names hidden. First only where the chord changes, then a number for every bar, checked with Show chords, then a new song with a Bridge. No instrument is named, the controls carry the tool's labels, and it states its moves (any key) with no selector in the text.",
