    ],
    "cells": [
      {
        "type": "section",
        "heading": "Where the chord changes",
        "minutes": 3,
        "cells": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Press Play below to start the band: a song with a Verse and a Chorus, with the chord names hidden. Each box is one bar, and the lit box is the bar playing.\nListen to the bass, which starts every bar on the root of its chord. Say \"change\" each time a new box brings a new chord.\nKeep going until you know which boxes hold the same chord as the box before them."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool",
            "tool": {
              "type": "song-chart",
              "key": "c",
              "bpm": 80,
              "sections": [
                {
                  "name": "Verse",
                  "bars": [
                    "C",
                    "C",
                    "F",
                    "C",
                    "Am",
                    "F",
                    "G",
                    "G"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "Chorus",
                  "bars": [
                    "F",
                    "G",
