            "text": "Press Play below to start the same song. On paper, write one number for each bar: 1, 4, 5 or 6. Write the bars you are sure of first, then fill the gaps as the song comes round.\nPress Show chords on the chart below to check. Under each chord's name the chart writes its number: I for 1, IV for 4, V for 5 and vi for 6.\nIf a bar is wrong, press Hide chords and listen to that bar again."
          },
